IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rta-forfeiture-accidents`

-- Road Traffic Act 1961, ss 65AA and 84 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_rta.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

§ `Fixtures`

`a drunk owner who kills` MEANS ForfeitureCase WITH
