#ASSERT `a person can be convicted of an offence under the cited subsection` `section 26(5), the offence of failing to stop`

#ASSERT `the seized vehicle must be released` 31 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the seized vehicle must be released` 29 FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the seized vehicle must be released` 60 TRUE

